OL,3,GNEWSAHospital face mask rule as
OL,4,Acritical incident ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FFace mask rules are being reintroduced
OL,7,Fby Sherwood Forest Hospitals NHS
OL,8,FFoundation Trust amid a rise in
OL,9,Frespiratory illnesses, including flu.
OL,11,FThe rules will be in place in several
OL,12,Fareas at King's Mill Hospital,
OL,13,FSutton-in-Ashfield, and the Urgent
OL,14,FTreatment Centre in Newark.
OL,16,FThe move comes after the trust, which
OL,17,Falso runs Mansfield Community Hospital,
OL,18,Fdeclared a critical incident on
OL,19,FWednesday afternoon. It was stood down
OL,20,Fon Thursday but the trust said its
OL,21,Fhospitals remained busy.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
