OL,3,GNEWSAHospital face mask rule as
OL,4,Acritical incident ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FFace masks, which will be available at
OL,7,Fstations near department entrances,
OL,8,Fwill be required in areas including the
OL,9,Femergency department and children's
OL,10,Fadmissions unit at King's Mill
OL,11,FHospital.
